# Frontend rules

- React function components only; keep feature folders focused (`auth`, `devices`, …).
- Session/device orchestration goes through `src/app/session-store.ts`.
- Do not embed modem CGI payloads or crypto in components.
- Use existing design tokens in `src/styles/global.css` (ink/paper/accent).
- Prefer Framer Motion for route/section transitions and list entrance — avoid noisy perpetual motion.
- No Inter/Roboto/Arial as primary UI fonts; keep Outfit + IBM Plex Mono unless replacing the system deliberately.
- Avoid purple-gradient “AI SaaS” aesthetics and generic dashboard card spam.
- Tailwind utility classes are fine; extract a shared component only after reuse is real.
